---
// Screen 3 of the question ladder: "why ~15% — and not a scam?" One terminal
// graphic carries the whole mechanism (v2 after review: the card-grid version
// was too text-heavy). Figures stay in sync with the math section (~3.3 +
// ~11.9 ≈ ~15).
---

<section class="border-t border-border px-6 py-20 sm:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
      <h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
        Staked TRX earns <span class="text-accent">twice</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-text-muted">
        Votes are the small stream. Energy is the big one — usually wasted.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- the mechanism as one terminal graphic -->
    <div class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-xl overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-card">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-border px-4 py-2.5">
        <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-negative/60"></span>
        <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-warning/60"></span>
        <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-live/60"></span>
        <span class="mono ml-2 text-xs text-text-muted">yield breakdown</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mono p-5 text-sm sm:p-6 sm:text-base">
        <div>
          <span class="text-live">$</span> staked TRX
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <span><span class="text-text-muted">├── </span>votes<span class="text-text-muted"> → voting rewards</span></span>
          <span class="shrink-0">~3.3%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <span><span class="text-text-muted">└── </span>energy<span class="text-text-muted"> → rented out</span></span>
          <span class="shrink-0 font-bold text-accent">~11.9%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 border-t border-border pt-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-bold">
            <span>your wallet <span class="text-live">▮</span></span>
            <span class="text-accent">~15%</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-xl text-center text-sm text-text-muted">
      Every USDT transfer burns energy, and idle energy expires daily — renters pay you
      for what you'd otherwise waste.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-center text-xs text-text-muted/70">
      Rates float with the energy market — a live model, not a guarantee.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
